  "description": "<p>Mementos are granular to the second. F5 returns a 409 when multiple mementos are created within the same second. F6 currently allows it, but only the state of the last memento created is retrievable.</p>\n\n<p>Example:</p>\n\n<p>curl -u fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/mem-test\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/mem-test</a> -H \"Link: &lt;<a href=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#NonRDFSource\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#NonRDFSource</a>&gt;; rel=type\" -v -H \"Content-Type: text/plain\" -X PUT --data-binary \"testing\"</p>\n\n<p>curl -u fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin -X POST -v <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/mem-test/fcr:versions\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/mem-test/fcr:versions</a> &amp;&amp; curl -u fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/mem-test\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/mem-test</a> -H \"Link: &lt;<a href=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#NonRDFSource\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#NonRDFSource</a>&gt;; rel=type\" -v -H \"Content-Type: text/plain\" -X PUT --data-binary \"testing-update\" &amp;&amp; curl -u fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin -X POST -v <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/mem-test/fcr:versions\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/mem-test/fcr:versions</a></p>",
